            <div xml:id="d705">

                <pb facs="0804" n="702" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg702"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/840: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-06-17T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 17, 1919,
                                5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>For the Minister only—to be deciphered by him.</p>
                <p>Were you present at a recent meeting of a so-called British-American Association
                    which passed a resolution in reference to the Shantung settlement? Please answer
                    by cable, indicating whether the British Minister was present.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
